WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Welcome to Lee's Detective Agency.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000
We accept every manner of requests

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.875
and will do our best to meet your needs

00:00:05.875 --> 00:00:06.625
in goods delivery, pickup,

00:00:06.625 --> 00:00:07.500
infiltration, investigation,

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.875
arbitration, and conflict resolution.

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:11.125
We strive to serve you better.

00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:14.625
We can solve *anything* in Lungmen.

00:00:14.625 --> 00:00:15.250
And certainly,

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:17.125
except for detective work

00:00:17.125 --> 00:00:19.250
because that's police business...

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:22.000
Please don't expect this to be a detective show.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.625
The day just ended for someone.

00:00:51.375 --> 00:00:54.375
And the day just started for somebody.

00:00:56.875 --> 00:01:01.000
In empty streets I walked about

00:01:02.375 --> 00:01:06.125
Confessing my boredom out loud.

00:01:07.625 --> 00:01:09.375
I wanna keep feeling it

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.125
But you won't forget about this

00:01:14.375 --> 00:01:17.250
Knock Three Times, before requesting.

00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:20.000
I wanna keep touching it

00:01:20.125 --> 00:01:23.875
Trouble's no longer a thing

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:26.250
When a future

00:01:26.625 --> 00:01:29.375
You just waved to me.

00:01:29.375 --> 00:01:31.000
I wanna keep feeling it

00:01:31.375 --> 00:01:34.875
But you won't forget about this

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:40.000
Knock Three Times, before requesting.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:41.500
I wanna keep touching it

00:01:42.125 --> 00:01:45.875
Trouble's no longer a thing

00:01:45.875 --> 00:01:48.125
When a future

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:51.500
You just waved to me.

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:07.125
A Lapping of Waves

00:02:47.625 --> 00:02:49.750
I'll never finish my thesis.

00:02:52.375 --> 00:02:53.125
Hi!

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:57.500
You shouldn't study during an outing, you know.

00:02:57.875 --> 00:03:00.125
The boss wants us to move something.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.125
Can I take a photo of myself with your new ride?

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:02.750
Where did you get all this money? You even invited us to the beach.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:06.250
I hope you didn't borrow from loan sharks. They're dangerous.

00:04:07.875 --> 00:04:09.875
I'm doing better than you think.

00:04:10.625 --> 00:04:12.000
Lee's DA made some money this year.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.125
I paid off my debts and bought a new car.

00:04:14.375 --> 00:04:17.625
I planned this outing to thank you all.

00:04:18.375 --> 00:04:20.500
You're the most generous boss ever!

00:04:22.375 --> 00:04:24.375
So get moving and carry my stuff.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.750
Well, the holiday is great.

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:46.250
We'll head out to the ocean to do some surfing. All expenses will be...

00:04:47.875 --> 00:04:48.875
Is that true?

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:56.750
Oooh. What happened, boss?

00:04:56.875 --> 00:04:58.375
Has spring returned to the withered branch?

00:04:59.625 --> 00:05:01.000
The old tree has blossomed once more.

00:05:01.625 --> 00:05:03.000
And something stirs deep inside.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.250
Go, Uncle Lee!

00:05:05.375 --> 00:05:07.750
Be the eligible bachelor that you always wanted to be!

00:05:08.125 --> 00:05:10.250
I'm just appreciating beauty.

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:13.250
It's a noble pursuit in its own right.

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:30.625
I finally submitted my thesis! Let's play ball!

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:33.625
Be careful and don't hurt anyone.

00:05:33.625 --> 00:05:34.250
Alright.

00:05:34.625 --> 00:05:35.500
Not interested.

00:05:35.625 --> 00:05:36.750
I'm going swimming.

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:38.875
Mmm.

00:05:39.125 --> 00:05:39.500
Let's go!

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:46.625
Try to play nice.

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.000
Come get some!

00:05:51.375 --> 00:05:52.625
What did you drink?

00:05:53.375 --> 00:05:55.500
Aak's special functional sports drink.

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:08.500
BOSS!

00:06:12.375 --> 00:06:13.500
Bad news for you.

00:06:13.875 --> 00:06:17.375
Of course, you can keep appreciating that married beauty of yours.
(There, there. Come on.)

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:19.500
You got lucky!

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:21.500
(Alright, you are fine now.)

00:06:22.291 --> 00:06:23.125
(Go have fun!)

00:06:25.625 --> 00:06:26.750
BOSS!

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:51.250
We got a situation.

00:06:55.875 --> 00:06:57.625
Mom! MOM! *Gurgling*

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:29.875
MOM!

00:07:31.375 --> 00:07:32.375
MOM!

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:34.375
Oh! Thank goodness!

00:07:35.125 --> 00:07:36.875
MOM!

00:07:38.375 --> 00:07:41.000
The beach is closing.

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:43.375
Please pack your belongings

00:07:43.375 --> 00:07:44.500
and leave ASAP.

00:07:46.375 --> 00:07:48.125
Starfishman saved me!

00:07:51.625 --> 00:07:52.375
I...

00:07:53.125 --> 00:07:55.500
I'm Starfishman.

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:57.500
Lee?

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:02.375
Ah, how long has it been?

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:03.125
Shao.

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:06.125
Thank you.

00:08:06.375 --> 00:08:08.500
Fate allowed us to meet again.

00:08:09.125 --> 00:08:10.625
We haven't seen each other for over 20 years.

00:08:11.375 --> 00:08:12.750
Yeah.

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.375
How are you doing?

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.500
Shao, we should leave soon.

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:20.875
Okay.

00:08:21.625 --> 00:08:22.875
Say goodbye to Starfishman.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:24.750
Bye, Starfishman!

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:27.125
Bye!

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:29.500
Your drink messed me up again!

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:31.250
Look, I'm sorry, okay.

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:34.000
Once we head back, I'll be tossing out your lousy stuff.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:38.250
Well, you might need it again in the future.

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:40.541
Simmer down, people. We'll talk about this when we get back.

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:19.375
This request is confidential and completed under my meticulous arrangements.

00:09:19.375 --> 00:09:23.625
Feel free to take the rewards for DA's team building.

00:09:23.625 --> 00:09:27.791
You're welcome.

00:09:27.791 --> 00:09:32.750
To be continued...

